  "payload": {
    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>Sahil Bloom</strong><h1>20个将定义你人生的悖论（阅读本文）</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">悖论是一种看似荒谬或自相矛盾的陈述，当被研究或解释时，可能被证明是正确的。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我整理了一份我观察到的悖论清单。这些重要的真理将定义你的人生。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">以下是人生中最强大的20个悖论：</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">增长悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">成长需要比你想象的长得多的时间才能到来，但一旦发生，速度会比你曾经想象的快得多。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">成长是逐渐发生的，然后突然发生。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">生活中最美好的事物来自让复利发挥其魔力。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">慢慢地，然后一下子。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">说服悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你有没有注意到，最爱争论的人很少能说服任何人？</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">有说服力的人不争辩——他们观察、倾听并提出深思熟虑的问题。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">少争辩，多说服。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">说服是一门需要画笔而非大锤的艺术。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">生产力悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作更久，完成更少。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">帕金森定律指出，工作会膨胀以填满为其完成所分配的时间。当你为工作设定固定时间时，你会找到无效率的方式来填满这些时间。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">像狮子一样工作——全力冲刺，休息，重复。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">恐惧悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你最害怕的事情往往是你最需要做的事情。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">恐惧，当被回避时，会成为我们进步的限制因素。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">世界上最成功的人都养成了主动面对令他们极度恐惧的事物的习惯。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">养成靠近自己恐惧的习惯——把它们当作吸引你能量的磁铁，你会在另一端发现成长。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">智能悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">智慧可能导致愚蠢。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">高智商的人更容易因为自认为比系统更聪明而沦为愚蠢的牺牲品。他们会把事情复杂化，而不是去做那些枯燥但有效的简单事情。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">永远不要自作聪明。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">建议悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">听取更多建议可能会让你准备得不够充分。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">刺耳的真相：大部分建议都很糟糕。这些建议虽出于好意，但用别人的现实地图来指引自己的人生是很危险的。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">成功者构建筛选机制，有选择地采纳建议——提取信号，忽略噪音。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">努力悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">轻松优雅的表演仅仅是大量需要付出努力、坚韧不拔的练习的结果。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你必须付出更多努力，才能让事情看起来毫不费力。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">小事变成大事，简单并不简单。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">智慧悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我学得越多，就越意识到自己还有多少不知道的。</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你学得越多，就越会接触到浩瀚的未知。这应该是令人振奋的，而不是令人恐惧的。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">拥抱自己的无知。拥抱终身学习。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">机遇悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">承担更少，完成更多。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">成功并非来自于什么都去做。而是来自于专注——对真正重要的项目的深度专注。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">对重要的事情说“是”，对其他一切说“不”。你的时间是值得珍惜的资产。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">无聊悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最具创意、最引人入胜的想法直接源于极度无聊时期。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你觉得无聊，思绪飘忽，想法交织——创意灵感突然涌现。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">无聊激发创造力。在你的每周中安排更多的无聊时间。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">社交媒体悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">更多连接性，更少连接</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">社交媒体已经创造了比以往任何时候都更多的连接感，但我们却感觉与身边的人连接得更少了。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">安排时间断开连接，你会感到更多的联系。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">失败悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你失败得越多，成功得就越多。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我们成长中的变革性时刻往往直接源于我们最艰难的失败时刻。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">不要害怕失败——学会聪明且快速地失败。永远不要以同样的方式失败两次。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">永远置身于赛场。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">对话悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我们有两只耳朵和一张嘴，这样我们就能听的比说的多一倍。\" - 爱比克泰德</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">少说话，多表达。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你希望自己的话语和想法被倾听，首先要少说多听。你会在自己的话语中发现更多力量。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">速度悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你必须放慢速度才能加快速度。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">慢下来使你能够恢复精力，注意到你之前忽略的事情，让你的行动更加审慎，并专注于最高杠杆机会。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">慢即是快。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">视觉悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">停止寻找，为了找到你正在寻找的东西。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你有没有注意到，当你在寻找某样东西时，你很少能找到它？别再找了——你要找的东西可能会来找你。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">同样适用于爱、事业、幸福和生活。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">伊卡洛斯悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">伊卡洛斯打造了翅膀并起飞。因成功而变得大胆，他飞得离太阳太近，这融化了翅膀并使伊卡洛斯坠落身亡。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在位者凭借一事成功，却因过度自信而忽视了即将到来的干扰。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">让你成功的东西，可能会埋下你失败的祸根。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">收缩悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你可能需要先收缩，才能成长。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">增长从来不是恒定且线性的。减法可能感觉像是退步，但这是长期增长的必要条件。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我们都需要秉持“少即是好”的理念。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">退一步，进两步是持续、长期成功的秘诀。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">金钱悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你必须先赔钱才能赚钱。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每一位成功的投资者和创业者，在其职业生涯中都有从惨痛损失中吸取的宝贵经验教训的故事。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">有时你必须付费学习。永远要亲身投入。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">新闻悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你接触的新闻越多，你就会变得越不消息灵通。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">纳西姆·塔勒布（Nassim Taleb）提出的“噪声瓶颈”概念认为，更多的数据会导致更高的噪声-信号比，因此通过获取更多数据，你最终反而对实际发生的情况了解得更少。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">想了解更多关于这个世界吗？关掉新闻，去亲身感受它吧。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">死亡悖论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你必须知道自己的死亡，才能真正地生活。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Memento Mori 是斯多葛学派关于死亡的必然性和不可避免性的提醒。它并非为了让人感到病态，而是为了阐明、启发并激励。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">通过接受我们的时间是有限的，我们能够体会到它的珍贵本质。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">那些是生活中最强大的20个悖论。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">研究矛盾。了解陷阱。拥抱混乱。这就是活得精彩的秘诀。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你会往列表里添加什么？你生活中的哪些重要真理常常在表面上显得相互矛盾？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">P.S. Join 800,000+ readers who get these ideas straight to their inboxes </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://www.sahilbloom.com/newsletter\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这里</span></span></a><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">.</span></div></p></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "悖论是一种看似荒谬或自相矛盾的陈述，当被研究或解释时，可能被证明是正确的。\n我整理了一份我观察到的悖论清单。这些重要的真理将定义你的人生。\n以下是人生中最强大的20个悖论：\n增长悖论\n成长需要比你想象的长得多的时间才能到来，但一旦发生，速度会比你曾经想象的快得多。\n成长是逐渐发生的，然后突然发生。\n生活中最美好的事物来自让复利发挥其魔力。\n慢慢地，然后一下子。\n说服悖论\n你有没有注意到，最爱争论的人很少能说服任何人？\n有说服力的人不争辩——他们观察、倾听并提出深思熟虑的问题。\n少争辩，多说服。\n说服是一门需要画笔而非大锤的艺术。\n生产力悖论\n工作更久，完成更少。\n帕金森定律指出，工作会膨胀以填满为其完成所分配的时间。当你为工作设定固定时间时，你会找到无效率的方式来填满这些时间。\n像狮子一样工作——全力冲刺，休息，重复。\n恐惧悖论\n你最害怕的事情往往是你最需要做的事情。\n恐惧，当被回避时，会成为我们进步的限制因素。\n世界上最成功的人都养成了主动面对令他们极度恐惧的事物的习惯。\n养成靠近自己恐惧的习惯——把它们当作吸引你能量的磁铁，你会在另一端发现成长。\n智能悖论\n智慧可能导致愚蠢。\n高智商的人更容易因为自认为比系统更聪明而沦为愚蠢的牺牲品。他们会把事情复杂化，而不是去做那些枯燥但有效的简单事情。\n永远不要自作聪明。\n建议悖论\n听取更多建议可能会让你准备得不够充分。\n刺耳的真相：大部分建议都很糟糕。这些建议虽出于好意，但用别人的现实地图来指引自己的人生是很危险的。\n成功者构建筛选机制，有选择地采纳建议——提取信号，忽略噪音。\n努力悖论\n轻松优雅的表演仅仅是大量需要付出努力、坚韧不拔的练习的结果。\n你必须付出更多努力，才能让事情看起来毫不费力。\n小事变成大事，简单并不简单。\n智慧悖论\n我学得越多，就越意识到自己还有多少不知道的。\n你学得越多，就越会接触到浩瀚的未知。这应该是令人振奋的，而不是令人恐惧的。\n拥抱自己的无知。拥抱终身学习。\n机遇悖论\n承担更少，完成更多。\n成功并非来自于什么都去做。而是来自于专注——对真正重要的项目的深度专注。\n对重要的事情说“是”，对其他一切说“不”。你的时间是值得珍惜的资产。\n无聊悖论\n最具创意、最引人入胜的想法直接源于极度无聊时期。\n你觉得无聊，思绪飘忽，想法交织——创意灵感突然涌现。\n无聊激发创造力。在你的每周中安排更多的无聊时间。\n社交媒体悖论\n更多连接性，更少连接\n社交媒体已经创造了比以往任何时候都更多的连接感，但我们却感觉与身边的人连接得更少了。\n安排时间断开连接，你会感到更多的联系。\n失败悖论\n你失败得越多，成功得就越多。\n我们成长中的变革性时刻往往直接源于我们最艰难的失败时刻。\n不要害怕失败——学会聪明且快速地失败。永远不要以同样的方式失败两次。\n永远置身于赛场。\n对话悖论\n我们有两只耳朵和一张嘴，这样我们就能听的比说的多一倍。\" - 爱比克泰德\n少说话，多表达。\n如果你希望自己的话语和想法被倾听，首先要少说多听。你会在自己的话语中发现更多力量。\n速度悖论\n你必须放慢速度才能加快速度。\n慢下来使你能够恢复精力，注意到你之前忽略的事情，让你的行动更加审慎，并专注于最高杠杆机会。\n慢即是快。\n视觉悖论\n停止寻找，为了找到你正在寻找的东西。\n你有没有注意到，当你在寻找某样东西时，你很少能找到它？别再找了——你要找的东西可能会来找你。\n同样适用于爱、事业、幸福和生活。\n伊卡洛斯悖论\n伊卡洛斯打造了翅膀并起飞。因成功而变得大胆，他飞得离太阳太近，这融化了翅膀并使伊卡洛斯坠落身亡。\n在位者凭借一事成功，却因过度自信而忽视了即将到来的干扰。\n让你成功的东西，可能会埋下你失败的祸根。\n收缩悖论\n你可能需要先收缩，才能成长。\n增长从来不是恒定且线性的。减法可能感觉像是退步，但这是长期增长的必要条件。\n我们都需要秉持“少即是好”的理念。\n退一步，进两步是持续、长期成功的秘诀。\n金钱悖论\n你必须先赔钱才能赚钱。\n每一位成功的投资者和创业者，在其职业生涯中都有从惨痛损失中吸取的宝贵经验教训的故事。\n有时你必须付费学习。永远要亲身投入。\n新闻悖论\n你接触的新闻越多，你就会变得越不消息灵通。\n纳西姆·塔勒布（Nassim Taleb）提出的“噪声瓶颈”概念认为，更多的数据会导致更高的噪声-信号比，因此通过获取更多数据，你最终反而对实际发生的情况了解得更少。\n想了解更多关于这个世界吗？关掉新闻，去亲身感受它吧。\n死亡悖论\n你必须知道自己的死亡，才能真正地生活。\nMemento Mori 是斯多葛学派关于死亡的必然性和不可避免性的提醒。它并非为了让人感到病态，而是为了阐明、启发并激励。\n通过接受我们的时间是有限的，我们能够体会到它的珍贵本质。\n那些是生活中最强大的20个悖论。\n研究矛盾。了解陷阱。拥抱混乱。这就是活得精彩的秘诀。\n你会往列表里添加什么？你生活中的哪些重要真理常常在表面上显得相互矛盾？\nP.S. Join 800,000+ readers who get these ideas straight to their inboxes 这里."
  },
